(155, '小程序店铺列表页面', '155', 1656306545, 1656306545, '<!--markdown--><p><span style=\"color: #7ccd7d;\">&lt;!--index.wxml--&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">view</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">class</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">=&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #fa8072;\">shop-item</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&quot;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">wx:for</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">=&quot;{{</span><span style=\"color: #d0d0d0;\">shopList</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">}}&quot;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">wx:if</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">=&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #fa8072;\">id</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&quot;&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">view</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">class</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&nbsp;=&quot;</span><span style=\"color: #fa8072;\">thumb</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&quot;&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">image</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">src</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">=&quot;{{</span><span style=\"color: #d0d0d0;\">item</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">.</span><span style=\"color: #d0d0d0;\">image</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">}}&quot;&gt;&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">image</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&gt;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">view</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&gt;</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #71c7ff;\">view</span><span style=\"color: #89ddff;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #c0c0c0;\">class</span><span style=